      "statement": "The Docker quickstart uses MongoDB 8.0, seeds sample products via /etc/init-data.js, and runs the Facet image built FROM softinstigate/restheart:9.12.3 (bumped from the 9.7.x line) with templates from /templates, accessible at http://localhost:8080/mydb/products with admin/secret credentials; the plugin required no source changes for this base image bump.",
