      "id": "claim_fb93237fc0784d17be007ff67cc7cd75",
      "statement": "Facet intercepts HTTP responses at the RESPONSE phase: if the request accepts HTML and a matching template exists, it renders HTML via Pebble; otherwise, the original JSON response passes through unchanged.",
